<title>USA: Tech-Sym seeks buyer for CogniSeis unit.</title>
<headline>Tech-Sym seeks buyer for CogniSeis unit.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tech-Sym Corp said Wednesday it is seeking a buyer for its CogniSeis Development subsidiary.</p>
<p>Tech-Sym said a loss at CogniSeis reduced first quarter earnings by $0.13 a share. Tech-Sym today reported earnings for the quarter of $0.40 a share.</p>
<p>It said it had received &quot;indications of interest&quot; from several companies regarding CogniSeis.</p>
<p>Tech-Sym makes electronic systems and components used in seismic exploration and other markets.</p>
</text>
